   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Blue Jays and Cardinals**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2005-05-04.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 16 songs; 61 min [1]. Said about its sound: Mic cord pull caused a skip, later edited in Audacity to reduce jarring gaps [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Blue Jays and Cardinals\", California Song, JV [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2005-05-04.flac16**: taped by Thomas J Hartnett; transferred by Thomas J Hartnett; source: AUD [1]. Also: Tracks split in Fission and normalized in Audacity, without compression, unlike previous solo shows [1]",
